Hydro
-----

Upstream: https://github.com/hydro-dev/Hydro
Authors: Hydro developers and contributors.

The site integrates the following separately installed upstream packages:

  hydrooj 5.0.7: AGPL-3.0-or-later OR Proprietary
  @hydrooj/ui-default 4.58.5: AGPL-3.0
  @hydrooj/framework: MIT (an underlying framework dependency)

TTOJ uses the open-source AGPL option for hydrooj; this repository does not
grant or include an alternative proprietary authorization from Hydro.
The MIT license of the underlying framework does not change the licenses
of hydrooj or its default UI. Upstream package license and copyright
notices remain applicable to those packages and their dependencies.

The site/tt-site package declares AGPL-3.0-or-later. Its Hydro-derived
templates, including problem lists, domain dashboards, record displays,
navigation and footer overrides, retain the upstream UI's AGPL terms.
Changes adapt these templates for Tenstorrent problems, language selection,
administrator-controlled access, and profiling reports. The plugin also
extends Hydro's native record handler. These modifications are included
in this repository; the unmodified upstream packages are obtained by the
versioned installation commands in site/Dockerfile.

